       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · News18 India · 2026-09-23 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>IIT-B Suicide Probe Focuses on Digital Data Retrieval, Including ChatGPT History</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#IIT-B</span> <span>#Student Suicide</span> <span>#Investigation</span> <span>#Digital Forensics</span></div>
       <p>The ongoing investigation into the IIT-Bombay student suicide case is now centering on digital forensics. Investigators are actively working to retrieve crucial data from a device pertinent to the case. This effort is part of a broader strategy to piece together the sequence of events leading to the tragic incident.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-23/iit-b-suicide-probe-focuses-on-digital-data-retrieval-includ.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>A key focus of the data retrieval includes examining the individual’s ChatGPT history. Authorities believe that information gleaned from this digital footprint could be vital in verifying various allegations that have surfaced during the inquiry. The objective is to establish a comprehensive understanding of the circumstances.</p><p>By analyzing the digital records, investigators aim to corroborate existing information and uncover new details that might shed light on the motivations and factors involved. This step highlights the increasing role of digital evidence in modern investigations, particularly in cases involving complex personal circumstances.</p><p>What to watch: Developments in the data retrieval process and any subsequent findings that emerge from the analysis.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The summary is correctly represented in the article text.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.news18.com/india/iit-bombay-student-suicide-professor-doolla-sent-on-leave-to-be-questioned-by-crime-branch-ws-l-10347362.html" rel="noopener">News18 India</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
