     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · The Hindu · 2026-09-23 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>LPG eKYC Deadline Nears: Complete Process by October 1</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#LPG</span> <span>#eKYC</span> <span>#India</span> <span>#Deadline</span></div>
       <p>Domestic LPG consumers across India are urged to complete their eKYC process well in advance of the impending October 1 deadline. This mandate is crucial for all users of domestic liquefied petroleum gas connections. Non-compliance by the specified date could lead to issues concerning their LPG services.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-23/lpg-ekyc-deadline-nears-complete-process-by-october-1.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The eKYC procedure offers flexibility for consumers, providing both offline and online avenues for completion. Individuals can opt to visit their designated gas agency, where personnel are available to assist with the necessary verification steps. This traditional method ensures direct support for those who may require it or prefer in-person interaction.</p><p>For consumers seeking a more convenient, at-home solution, the eKYC process can be accomplished digitally. This involves downloading the specific mobile applications provided by their respective LPG service providers. These applications are designed to guide users through the identity verification process, enabling them to link their authenticated details to their existing LPG connection without needing to leave their homes.</p><p>The October 1 deadline has been established to ensure a comprehensive authentication of all domestic LPG connections, enhancing transparency and service delivery. It is imperative for consumers to prioritize this task to prevent any potential interruptions or complications with their LPG supply. Both agency visits and mobile app completion are structured to be user-friendly, emphasizing the importance of timely adherence to the new regulations.</p><p>What to watch: Potential official announcements regarding extensions or penalties post-October 1.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article accurately reflects the source information regarding the LPG eKYC process.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/lpg-ekyc-deadline-how-to-complete-and-what-happens-if-you-dont-finish-it-by-october-1/article71499493.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
