      <ul><li><a href="https://variety.com/2026/tv/news/netflix-two-new-seasons-chefs-table-desserts-icons-1236872698/" rel="noopener">Variety</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
