     <article class="story single" data-beat="entertainment">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · TOI Entertainment · 2026-09-23 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Radhika Apte Opens Up on Trauma of Leaked Intimate Scene</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Entertainment</span> <span>#Bollywood</span> <span>#Privacy</span> <span>#Radhika Apte</span></div>
       <p>Actress Radhika Apte has candidly spoken about the profound and lasting effects that a leaked intimate scene had on her life. The incident plunged her into a period of significant fear, prompting her to withdraw from public life and remain indoors for four consecutive days as she grappled with the breach of privacy.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-23/radhika-apte-opens-up-on-trauma-of-leaked-intimate-scene.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The repercussions of the leak were extensive, impacting not only Apte's personal sense of safety and well-being but also creating strain within her closest relationships. She noted that the situation adversely affected her interactions and bonds with both friends and family members, highlighting the broad emotional and social toll such incidents can take on individuals.</p><p>In the wake of the unsettling experience, Apte sought comfort and reassurance, consulting with her driver and other staff members. This support system helped her navigate the immediate aftermath of the traumatic event. Despite the personal challenges, Apte has demonstrated remarkable resilience, continuing to pursue her career in the entertainment industry. Her recent projects include an appearance in the latest installment of the anthology series, 'Lust Stories 3', showcasing her ongoing commitment to her craft. Her public statement underscores the severe personal and professional hurdles faced by those in the public eye when their privacy is compromised.</p><p>What to watch: Radhika Apte in 'Lust Stories 3'.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article captures the essence of the source summary accurately.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/entertainment/hindi/bollywood/news/i-literally-couldnt-step-out-of-the-house-for-four-days-lust-stories-3-star-radhika-apte-opens-up-about-trauma-of-leaked-intimate-scene-as-people-around-her-began-seeing-discussing-the-clip-recalls-asking-staff-to-protect-her/articleshow/134434640.cms" rel="noopener">TOI Entertainment</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
